# Family Manager password-reset OpenDKIM — APPROVAL-GATED TEMPLATE ONLY.
# Place the private key outside the repository with owner root:opendkim and
# mode 0640 or stricter, then substitute the KeyTable placeholder.

Syslog yes
SyslogSuccess yes
LogWhy yes
UMask 007
Mode s
Canonicalization relaxed/simple
Domain family.multihost.ing
Selector fm2026
KeyTable refile:/etc/opendkim/KeyTable
SigningTable refile:/etc/opendkim/SigningTable
InternalHosts refile:/etc/opendkim/TrustedHosts
ExternalIgnoreList refile:/etc/opendkim/TrustedHosts
Socket local:/run/opendkim/opendkim.sock
RequireSafeKeys true
OversignHeaders From
